Z||000007||Spiff||12-14-2001||12:21 AM||||VeeSixGeeTee<P>I bought the White face gauges covers at Carlisle 2 years ago. But you can buy them at *Cough* I won't say where cause that place is not doing very smart business these days. I.E. stealing other peoples ideas and selling them for their own.<P>E-Bay has some White face gauges on there some times, and they are only $16.<P>The White turn signal gauges were made by Josh Bumpus (sp). I don't know in he is on the forum. Probably is just don't remember at this time.<P>The red Pegasus in the steering wheel was had painted by me.<P>Hope this helps.<P><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spiffsig2_14.gif">  <P><BR>Why can't I spell tonite.<p>[This message has been edited by Spiff (edited 12-14-2001).]||||reg||1
